  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Welcome to Reel Deal Fishin' Charters</p>
      <h2>Nothing Like the Big Crowded Boats</h2>
      <p class="lead">Looking for a Florida fishing trip that's laid back, full of action and nothing like the big crowded boats? You've come to the right coast.</p>
      <p>New Smyrna Beach is one of Florida's best kept secrets, and Capt. Chad Knight has spent years getting dialed into every bank, bend and bite. From <a href="/inshore#redfish">redfish in the shallows</a> to <a href="/shark-fishing">sharks just off the beach</a>, these trips reflect real local experience.</p>
      <p><strong>Capt. Chad fishes where the bite is, not where the brochure says to go.</strong></p>
      <p>Whether you're fishing, cruising or just looking to try something different, we'll make it a day (or night) you won't forget.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--navy" href="/charters">See All Charters</a>
    </div>
    <div class="split__media"><img src="/images/home-a.webp" alt="Family with a catch of sheepshead on the Reel Deal boat" width="800" height="680" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--sand">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__head sec__head--center">
      <p class="eyebrow">Charter trips &amp; tours</p>
      <h2>Pick Your Trip</h2>
      <p>Every trip is private and launches from New Smyrna Beach. See current rates and open dates on our booking page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      {%- for t in trips %}
      <article class="card">
        <a class="card__img" href="{{ t.url }}"><img src="/images/{{ t.img }}.webp" alt="{{ t.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"><span class="card__tag{% if t.signature %} card__tag--red{% endif %}">{{ t.tag }}</span></a>
        <div class="card__body">
          <h3><a href="{{ t.url }}">{{ t.name }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ t.hook }}</p>
          <div class="card__links"><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ t.url }}">Learn More</a><a class="btn btn--red" href="{{ t.book }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book Now</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--navy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Fishing New Smyrna Beach &amp; Daytona</p>
      <h2>Where We Fish</h2>
      <p>Capt. Chad adjusts each trip to the season, the tides and the bite, not some preset route. One day might mean redfish in the lagoon. The next, kingfish just off the breakers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="places">
      <div class="place"><h3>New Smyrna Beach</h3><p>Home base, with fast access to the inlet, the bridges and the nearshore Atlantic.</p></div>
      <div class="place"><h3>Indian River Lagoon</h3><p>Calm backwaters for redfish, trout, snook, dolphins and the glow.</p></div>
      <div class="place"><h3>Mosquito Lagoon</h3><p>Skinny water flats known for sight fishing.</p></div>
      <div class="place"><h3><a href="/daytona-beach">Daytona Beach</a></h3><p>A short drive away. Private inshore and nearshore trips for Daytona visitors.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:30px"><strong>Common targets:</strong> redfish, trout, snook and flounder &middot; tarpon, kingfish, cobia and sharks &middot; sheepshead, black drum, mullet and blue crabs.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
