      <p class="eyebrow">Your captain</p>
      <h2>Meet Capt. Chad Knight</h2>
      <p>Capt. Chad Knight owns Reel Deal Fishin' Charters. He grew up loving the outdoors and moved to Florida from Tennessee when he was 11. Since then, the water's been his home.</p>
      <p>He built the business around three things that mean the most to him: God, family and fishing. He's great with kids and works hard to give first timers and seasoned anglers alike a great day on the water.</p>
      <p><span class="badge">USCG 50 Ton Master License</span><span class="badge">Towing endorsement</span><span class="badge">Great with kids</span></p>
      <a class="btn btn--navy" href="/about">More About Capt. Chad</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

